      "text": "Template\n    - id\n    - templateKey\n    - templateId\n    - clientId (Client who uses this service)\n    - dltId\n    - content (webhook URL and body/msg body)\n    - channel (webhook/sms/email/push)\n    - category (promo/trans)\n    - quota (per-template quota)",
